{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1787030376534929001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"mechanical-grabbable-wolverine","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":4,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"f9416e1f9543962dc3bf640f94657311236303282234d06c1fd6dc2770403493","event_uuid":"05d56f80-4ccf-46b3-82e7-687a654ce07f","position":{"commit_sha":"1a4329ed2cbc5daa7905906a6517c5c11e710cdf","position":"1787028249734477001-05d56f80-4ccf-46b3-82e7-687a654ce07f"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"fb1799c2c6a47ee9ba9bc40124f45d6adeb693356348378ab3a0751af2dbfdd4","event_uuid":"5edb03be-4608-4429-9f3c-7c0da948efb4","position":{"commit_sha":"b7ae01ef8ad34a1081148f42b5cf110761854485","position":"1787028267767764001-5edb03be-4608-4429-9f3c-7c0da948efb4"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"5648ab731a25ab0f4e83de1f66edcd9155a67163e2862bcf53f592a0c6aff8ea","event_uuid":"77cf3f0c-7439-47a7-89bb-28c1fa491455","position":{"commit_sha":"3d644f5c48109c205cb1fca145f3579777ef27b8","position":"1787028273454783001-77cf3f0c-7439-47a7-89bb-28c1fa491455"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"537519495d0430dcba27381cd3293187fd43166797de10f8ee3dd4c8961df549","event_uuid":"f04591fa-ee6f-46cc-87d2-cab8c704607b","position":{"commit_sha":"ff2d1eeaf7ef329c026b7252105eedcbdd71a8ac","position":"1787028280251216001-f04591fa-ee6f-46cc-87d2-cab8c704607b"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787028249734477001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"f04591fa-ee6f-46cc-87d2-cab8c704607b","relation":"depends_on","target_id":"dd65-54fa-f4c3-4bc9"}],"description":"## Context\nThe coordinator and fuse remain inert until non-create families route through them. Cutover must preserve independent work, explicitly defer matching plans, and prove the new fuse would not have prematurely stopped historical successful or partially successful jobs.\n\n## Outcome\nMake typed coordination authoritative for non-create families behind an internal per-family rollback selector, persist explicit deferral metadata, replace the rolling breaker, and emit exact pass outcomes.\n\n## Plan\n1. Venue-gate verified-fake Cloud/DC summary behavior, then change the internal operation-family default from legacy to coordinator; never dual-send.\n2. Route update, delete, probe, clean-label, repair-property, and conflict plans through coordinator/fuse. Preserve successful effects and recover rollback by re-observation.\n3. Defer remaining matching plans with scope/reason/`retry_not_before`; let independent scopes continue.\n4. Preserve exact applied/failed/deferred/skipped/recovered tallies and nonzero degraded-pass signaling.\n5. Replay the sanitized 1,200-run completed GitHub Actions slice. Count only normalized terminal outcomes, never warning/grep text, and prove zero premature termination of observed successful/partial work.\n\n## Testing\nVerified-fake batches assert wire order/call ceilings/tallies/logs/exit. Historical replay names any counterfactual stop and blocks if it predates observed later success.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Each non-create family has one coordinator route and one internal legacy rollback value with no dual-send.\n- [ ] Venue-gated Cloud/DC verified fakes pass before the coordinator default changes.\n- [ ] Matching remaining work is deferred with exact scope, reason, and `retry_not_before`, while independent scopes continue.\n- [ ] Applied, failed, deferred, skipped, and recovered tallies plus degraded exit status are exact.\n- [ ] The rolling 5-of-10 breaker is unreachable for migrated families.\n- [ ] Historical replay of the completed 1,200-run slice shows zero premature stop before observed successful or partially successful work.\n\n## Out of scope\nCreate coordination remains S4; final legacy removal remains S5.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/applier.py","reason":"Route non-create families through the coordinator."},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/batch_dispatch.py","reason":"Retire compound replay and rolling breaker for migrated families."},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/dispatch_apply_phases.py","reason":"Carry deferral, fuse, and exact phase outcomes."},{"path":"tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/mutate/test_operation_coordinator.py","reason":"Verified-fake routing, wire, tally, log, and exit tests."},{"path":"tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/mutate/test_scoped_pass_fuse.py","reason":"Integrated fuse and historical replay tests."},{"path":"tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/test_live_mode_failure_tally.py","reason":"Exact degraded pass outcome regressions."},{"path":"tests/fixtures/reconciler/rp03_fuse_completed_slice.json","reason":"Sanitized 1,200-run completed historical outcome slice."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["depends_on","dd65-54fa-f4c3-4bc9"],["parent","28a3-a62d-6345-44a0"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"28a3-a62d-6345-44a0","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["rp03","coordinator","fuse","tdd"],"ticket_id":"67d4-ecba-cf95-4353","ticket_type":"task","title":"RP-03 S3 T3 — Cut over non-create routing with exact deferral and tally semantics","verify_commands":[{"command":"env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/pytest -q tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/mutate/test_operation_coordinator.py tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/mutate/test_scoped_pass_fuse.py tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/test_live_mode_failure_tally.py","dd_id":"AC1-AC5","dd_text":"Non-create route cutover, venue gate, deferral, exact tallies, and breaker removal"},{"command":"env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/pytest -q tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/mutate/test_scoped_pass_fuse.py -k historical","dd_id":"AC6","dd_text":"Sanitized 1,200-run historical counterfactual replay"}]},"source_event_uuids":["05d56f80-4ccf-46b3-82e7-687a654ce07f","5edb03be-4608-4429-9f3c-7c0da948efb4","77cf3f0c-7439-47a7-89bb-28c1fa491455","f04591fa-ee6f-46cc-87d2-cab8c704607b"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787030376534929001,"uuid":"0fc2a8be-7639-40c8-bdb8-014b366a6752"}